            "text": "{\"findings\":[{\"tipo\":\"DrawCalls\",\"causa_raiz\":\"Excesso massivo de chamadas de desenho individuais (pico de 13.967 contra o teto de 2.579), saturando o barramento CPU-GPU e causando gargalo crítico na GPU (41.78 ms). Isso decorre da ausência de agrupamento de malhas, falta de instanciamento de GPU (GPU Instancing) e excesso de materiais únicos ou objetos renderizados individualmente sem culling adequado.\",\"codigo_refatorado\":\"using UnityEngine;\\\\n\\\\n[RequireComponent(typeof(MeshFilter), typeof(MeshRenderer))]\\\\npublic class SimpleMeshCombiner : MonoBehaviour\\\\n{\\\\n    [ContextMenu(\\\\\\\"Combinar Malhas\\\\\\\")]\\\\n    public void CombineMeshes()\\\\n    {\\\\n        MeshFilter[] meshFilters = GetComponentsInChildren\u003cMeshFilter\u003e();\\\\n        CombineInstance[] combine = new CombineInstance[meshFilters.Length - 1];\\\\n        int combineIndex = 0;\\\\n        MeshFilter parentFilter = GetComponent\u003cMeshFilter\u003e();\\\\n\\\\n        for (int i = 0; i \u003c meshFilters.Length; i++)\\\\n        {\\\\n            if (meshFilters[i] == parentFilter) continue;\\\\n            combine[combineIndex].mesh = meshFilters[i].sharedMesh;\\\\n            combine[combineIndex].transform = transform.worldToLocalMatrix * meshFilters[i].transform.localToWorldMatrix;\\\\n            meshFilters[i].gameObject.SetActive(false);\\\\n            combineIndex++;\\\\n        }\\\\n\\\\n        Mesh finalMesh = new Mesh();\\\\n        finalMesh.indexFormat = UnityEngine.Rendering.IndexFormat.UInt32;\\\\n        finalMesh.CombineMeshes(combine, true, true);\\\\n        parentFilter.sharedMesh = finalMesh;\\\\n        gameObject.SetActive(true);\\\\n    }\\\\n}\",\"explicacao_didatica\":\"Pense em cada Draw Call como um garçom levando um prato por vez da cozinha (CPU) para a mesa do cliente (GPU). Com quase 14.000 pedidos separados, o trânsito trava e a placa de vídeo fica sobrecarregada (41.78 ms). O código fornecido atua unind